[statement]
A dependency on a name provided at a version is not followed at once, as a
real name is: `b` depends on `w`, provided at a version by `kw` alone, and
`v`, reached first under `a`, is decided before it, for `gk`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:a b

P:a
V:1
D:v

P:b
V:1
D:w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install a 1
install kw 1
install b 1
install app 1
